  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Audit Support through PASAI and the New Zealand Controller and Auditor General</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity provides:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Core and program funding to the Pacific Association of Supreme Audit Institutions (PASAI) to support Pacific audit institutions perform their core functions in line with PASAI&apos;s 2024-34 Strategy. The support is from 2024-29.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Funding to the New Zealand Controller and Auditor-General (CAG) to support the PASAI Secretariat and to provide twinning support to Cook Islands and Samoa.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Funding for&#xa0;the CAG to provide Tokelau audit services and strengthen oversight.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
